，收諸侯之兵以東擊楚，其意非盡吞天下者不休，其不知厭足如是甚也。且漢王不可必，身居項王掌握中數矣，項王憐而活之，然得脫，輒倍約，復擊項王，其不可親信如此。今足下雖自以與漢王爲厚交，爲之盡力用兵，終爲之所禽矣。足下所以得須臾至今者，以項王尚存也。當今二王之事，權在足下。足下右投則漢王勝，左投則項王勝。項王今日亡，則次取足下。足下與項王有故，何不反漢與楚連和，參分天下王之？今釋此時，而自必於漢以擊楚，且爲智者固若此乎！』韓信謝曰：『臣事項王，官不過郎中，位不過執戟，言不聽，畫不用，故倍楚而歸漢。漢王授我上將軍印，予我數萬眾，解衣衣我，推食食我，言聽計用，故吾得以至於此。夫人深親信我，我倍之不祥，雖死不易。幸爲信謝項王！』","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"龍且","kind":"person","person_id":"sr6_5zr_1f3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"ob7_g6i_7pp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"武涉","kind":"person","person_id":"3la_fcr_q0l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"齊王信","kind":"person","person_id":"ofc_8ei_jb7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0120","start":120,"end":122,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0128","start":128,"end":130,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"ob7_g6i_7pp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0136","start":136,"end":138,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"ob7_g6i_7pp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0153","start":153,"end":155,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"ob7_g6i_7pp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0171","start":171,"end":173,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0203","start":203,"end":205,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"ob7_g6i_7pp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0226","start":226,"end":228,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0233","start":233,"end":235,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"ob7_g6i_7pp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0237","start":237,"end":239,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"ob7_g6i_7pp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0252","start":252,"end":254,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"ob7_g6i_7pp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0297","start":297,"end":299,"surface":"韓信","kind":"person","person_id":"ofc_8ei_jb7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0305","start":305,"end":307,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"ob7_g6i_7pp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0335","start":335,"end":337,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0393","start":393,"end":394,"surface":"信","kind":"person","person_id":"ofc_8ei_jb7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m017-0395","start":395,"end":397,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"ob7_g6i_7pp","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin","book_id":"b-shiji-092","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-092-hanxin"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:p018","text":"武涉已去，齊人蒯通知天下權在韓信，欲爲奇策而感動之，以相人說韓信曰：『仆嘗受相人之術。』韓信曰：『先生相人何如？』對曰：『貴賤在於骨法，憂喜在於容色，成敗在於決斷，以此參之，萬不失一。』韓信曰：『善。先生相寡人何如？』對曰：『願少閒。』信曰：『左右去矣。』通曰：『相君之面，不過封侯，又危不安。相君之背，貴乃不可言。』韓信曰：『何謂也？』蒯通曰：『天下初發難也，俊雄豪桀建號壹呼，天下之士雲合霧集，魚鱗襍遝，熛至風起。當此之時，憂在亡秦而已。今楚漢分爭，使天下無罪之人肝膽涂地，父子暴骸骨於中野，不可勝數。楚人起彭城，轉鬬逐北，至於滎陽，乘利席卷，威震天下。然兵困於京、索之閒，迫西山而不能進者，三年於此矣。漢王將數十萬之眾，距鞏、雒，阻山河之險，一日數戰，無尺寸之功，折北不救，敗滎陽，傷成皋，遂走宛、葉之閒，此所謂智勇俱困者也。夫銳氣挫於險塞，而糧食竭於內府，百姓罷極怨望，容容無所倚。以臣料之，其勢非天下之賢聖固不能息天下之禍。當今兩主之命縣於足下。足下爲漢則漢勝，與楚則楚勝。臣願披腹心，輸肝膽，效愚計，恐足下不能用也。誠能聽臣之計，莫若兩利而俱存之，參分天下，鼎足而居，其勢莫敢先動。夫以足下之賢聖，有甲兵之眾，據彊齊，從燕、趙，出空虛之地而制其後，因民之欲，西鄉爲百姓請命，則天下風走而響應矣，孰敢不聽！割大弱彊，以立諸侯，諸侯已立，天下服聽而歸德於齊。案齊之故，有膠、泗之地，懷諸侯以德，深拱揖讓，則天下之君王相率而朝於齊矣。蓋聞天與弗取，反受其咎；時至不行，反受其殃。願足下孰慮之。』","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m018-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"武涉","kind":"person","person_id":"3la_fcr_q0l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m018-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"蒯通","kind":"person","person_id":"x9q_ghs_z2s","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m018-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"韓信","kind":"person","person_id":"ofc_8ei_jb7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m018-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"韓信","kind":"person","person_id":"ofc_8ei_jb7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m018-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"韓信","kind":"person","person_id":"ofc_8ei_jb7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m018-0093","start":93,"end":95,"surface":"韓信","kind":"person","person_id":"ofc_8ei_jb7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m018-0118","start":118,"end":119,"surface":"信","kind":"person","person_id":"ofc_8ei_jb7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m018-0122","start":122,"end":124,"surface":"左右","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者或未定指代保留原文，不補姓名成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m018-0128","start":128,"end":129,"surface":"通","kind":"person","person_id":"x9q_ghs_z2s","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m018-0159","start":159,"end":161,"surface":"韓信","kind":"person","person_id":"ofc_8ei_jb7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m018-0169","start":169,"end":171,"surface":"蒯通","kind":"person","person_id":"x9q_ghs_z2s","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-han